{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE5L0RhdW50bGVzcyUyMFRoZSUyMEJhdHRsZSUyME9mJTIwTWlkd2F5JTIwJTI4MjAxOSUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Dauntless The Battle Of Midway","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/udySr2TNzk5W7Q7pvWSwCNLSv2u.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cuqPNhNZkkdxghPagU2FeltiEKN.jpg","description":"By June 1942, the Japanese Navy has swept across the Pacific. In an effort to change the course of the war, a United States carrier group is positioned off the coast of Midway, tasked with springing a trap on the enemy. During this pivotal battle, the two-man crew of a U.S. Navy dive bomber is forced to ditch in the sea. Set adrift, the men look towards their comrades for rescue; namely, the ragtag crew of a PBY Catalina, who are sent to search for survivors. Amid the vast openness of the Pacific, with days passing and the chance of rescue fading, the men are forced to face their own mortality.\n\nRated NR · Released 22 Oct 2019 · United States of America · Language: English · 98 min\nStudio: Bayou Pictures\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2019","genres":["War","Action","Drama","History","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"4.3","runtime":"98 min","cast":["Judd Nelson","C. Thomas Howell","Mendel Fogelman","Aidan Bristow","James Austin Kerr","Jade Willey","John Enick","Byrne Offutt"],"director":["Mike Phillips"],"released":"2019-10-22T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Based on a true story","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Mike Phillips","character":"Director"},{"name":"Judd Nelson","character":"Rear Admirial Raymond Spruance","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7kRf8vE0ZjMuunh8BaD50B3EhS5.jpg"},{"name":"C. Thomas Howell","character":"Captain Miles Browning","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/739YbFWpAYyo9neHvBGThgmT4YH.jpg"},{"name":"Mendel Fogelman","character":"Doc","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/znDd936iNcaa9dHZHeBUOYDALt7.jpg"},{"name":"Aidan Bristow","character":"Pags